                <td morerows="0" valign="top" class="description-td">Cd-123 Fluon ® PTFE Resin (ICI of</td>
                <td morerows="0" valign="top" class="description-td">27.2</td>
                <td morerows="0" valign="top" class="description-td">kg</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="description-tr">
